# Bharat HIE Portal

React + Vite app. See `AGENTS.md` for routes and commands.

## Must follow
- Keep body/UI text readable: use `var(--fg)` / `var(--muted)`; never transparent or ultra-low-contrast text.
- New features go in `src/` React components; preserve `public/js/` script order when touching legacy portal logic.
- Asset URLs use `/assets/...` (files under `public/assets/`).
- Run `npm run test` after UI or route changes.
- Do not commit secrets or real patient data.
